--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12efb4e91f50acd42999f69a91d76dab, type: 3}
  m_Name: SnakeFarewell1_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 753499cfd0274996b830a0328388dfd9, type: 2}
    text: "C\u1eadu quen Usagi \xe0 Hachi? C\u1eadu \u1ea5y l\u1ea7n tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\xe3 cung c\u1ea5p nhu y\u1ebfu ph\u1ea9m cho ch\xfang t\xf4i, n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng c\xf3 c\u1eadu \u1ea5y ch\u1eafc ch\xfang t\xf4i \u0111\xe3 ch\u1ebft h\u1ebft r\u1ed3i."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 02a1fc921f4037d4bb7357b2fa36c700, type: 2}
    text: "\u0110\xfang v\u1eady, c\u1eadu \u1ea5y n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng m\xe0. Nh\xecn v\u1eady th\xf4i ch\u1ee9 c\u1eadu ta l\xe0 m\u1ed9t thi\xean t\xe0i trong c\xe1c ma thu\u1eadt \u1ea9n th\xe2n \u0111\u1ea5y. N\xean t\u1edbi ch\u1eafc \u0111\xf3 gi\u1edd c\u1eadu \u1ea5y v\u1eabn lu\xf4n gi\xfap \u0111\u1ee1 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xe2n nh\u01b0 m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u1edf \u0111\xe2y."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cdfbdabbf8285304690416cec3c5c792, type: 2}
    text: "T\xean qu\xe1i g\u1edf n\xe0y coi v\u1eady m\xe0 c\u0169ng t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ea5y ch\u1ee9."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 753499cfd0274996b830a0328388dfd9, type: 2}
    text: "N\xe8, nghe n\xf3i h\u1ed3i n\xe3y c\xe1c c\u1eadu \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1edbi Rohok. T\xf4i t\u1eb7ng con dao cho c\xe1c c\u1eadu \u0111\u1ea5y. Coi nh\u01b0 qu\xe0 t\u1ea1m bi\u1ec7t, ch\xfac c\xe1c c\u1eadu may m\u1eafn."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 02a1fc921f4037d4bb7357b2fa36c700, type: 2}
    text: "C\u1ea3m \u01a1n anh, t\xf4i s\u1ebd gi\u1ea3i tho\xe1t qu\u1ed1c gia n\xe0y."
